      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In this scene at the restaurant bar, Max panics while confiding in his friend Kostya. Convinced that Victoria has developed feelings for him, Max fears this will lead to a serious relationship, marriage, and unwanted family responsibilities. Listen to their conversation in Russian first, and then we will examine each sentence.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
