    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now, let us examine the vocabulary and phrasing of this honest conversation between friends.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Костя, кажется, Вика меня любит!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kostya, it seems Vika loves me!' Max shares his surprising realization with a troubled expression.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Класс! Или нет?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Great! Or is it?' Kostya wonders about his friend's mixed reaction.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Блин, Костя, это опасная ситуация.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Damn, Kostya, this is a dangerous situation.' Max expresses his growing anxiety about romance.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Если она меня любит, нужны отношения.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If she loves me, a relationship is needed.' Max worries about serious emotional commitments.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "А что плохого в отношениях?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what is bad about a relationship?' Kostya questions his dramatic reluctance.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Потом свадьба, а потом дети!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then a wedding, and then kids!' Max lists the inevitable stages of family life.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Зачем мне всё это сейчас?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why do I need all of this right now?' Max rejects settling down at this young age.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Ты просто боишься взрослой жизни.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are simply afraid of adult life.' Kostya teases his friend's childish fears.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я люблю свободу и приключения!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I love freedom and adventures!' Max defends his carefree bachelor lifestyle.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Вика взрослая и умная девушка.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Vika is a mature and smart girl.' Kostya reminds him of Victoria's serious character.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Она не будет терпеть твои глупости.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She will not tolerate your nonsense.' Kostya warns him about testing her patience.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Вот именно, она начнет меня воспитывать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Exactly, she will start educating me.' Max dreads losing control over his daily routine.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Тогда поговори с ней честно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then talk to her honestly.' Kostya offers sensible advice for resolving the issue.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Нет, лучше я буду молчать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
